OL,3,GNEWSA'A #12 dog toy bought from Amazon
OL,4,Akilled my dog'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heartbroken dog owner whose pet died
OL,7,Fafter swallowing part of a tug toy has
OL,8,Fwarned others about the dangers they
OL,9,Fcan pose.
OL,11,FAntonia Speariett, from Coppull in
OL,12,FLancashire, spoke to the BBC after her
OL,13,Ffive-year-old cane corso Cane died from
OL,14,Fan intestinal blockage caused by
OL,15,Fingesting part of a toy she had bought
OL,16,Fonline.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
