OL,3,GNEWSA'A #12 dog toy bought from Amazon
OL,4,Akilled my dog'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A #12 dog toy bought from Amazon
OL,7,Fkilled my dog," said the 31-year-old.
OL,8,F"Nothing prepared me for this
OL,9,Fheartbreak. If you are a dog owner who
OL,10,Fhas rope dog toys - throw them out. It
OL,11,Fis not worth it."
OL,13,FAn Amazon spokesperson said: "We were
OL,14,Fvery sorry to hear about this. We are
OL,15,Fin touch with the customer."
